{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>כי אם שמר תשמרון, כי</b> — in the sense of 'but,' and refers back to what is written above: 'and you shall perish quickly.' The meaning: if you are utterly destroyed quickly through the enticement of your heart, know that you shall not enter there again, <b>but if you keep</b> — etc. <b>Completed, the section of עקב.</b>"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The comment concludes with a colophon marking the end of the parashah; the final Hebrew phrase שלימא סדרא דפרשת עקב is a scribal/reader's marker, not part of the exegetical content."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:52:28.550838516Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}